==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|entomology|ist|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[scientist]] who [[studies]] [[insect]]s
#: ''The noted '''entomologist''' [[w:Charles W. Woodworth|Charles W. Woodworth]] suggested the use of [[w:Drosophila melanogaster|Drosophila melanogaster]] for [[genetic]] studies.''

